      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Upscale an image 2 or 4 times with SeedVR2",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Upscale an image 2 or 4 times with SeedVR2\n\nRaises the resolution of one image by 2 or 4 times with SeedVR2, a one-step diffusion restorer. The model file is an input, so the same graph runs the 3B and the 7B model. Built from Comfy's template utility_seedvr2_3b_int8_upscale_image.\n\n## Models\n\n- [seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors): SeedVR2 VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B).\n- [seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors): SeedVR2 3B, int8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
